2. ANTI-CHEATER RESTRICTIONS:
   (a) Permitted Educational Use: The Software MAY be used for homework
       assistance, step-by-step guidance, diagnostic feedback, and error
       correction, provided the user exhibits a genuine, non-zero effort to
       actually learn and understand the underlying concepts.
   (b) Prohibited Academic Dishonesty: The Software SHALL NOT be used to
       ghostwrite solutions, execute automated submission of graded
       tasks, or facilitate cheating on any exam, quiz, test, or homework
       assignment where the user simply copies outputs without educational
       intent. No one likes cheaters.

3. VIDEO GAME CHEATING RESTRICTIONS:
   Exclusive Valorant Exemption: Notwithstanding Section 2(b), if the
   Software is used for the express purpose of video game cheating, it
   MAY ONLY be incorporated into cheats for Riot Games' Valorant (regardless
   of how mathematically impossible or absurd that may be).

